DGET&quot;'-e98b0e3987476ebdEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_002_PrayerBook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_002_PrayerBook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_WYR_OpenHand_TieflingVictim_002_PrayerBook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e412b23f-d178-4b91-89bd-5ce031b25671</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e412b23f-d178-4b91-89bd-5ce031b25671\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e412b23f-d178-4b91-89bd-5ce031b25671\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Open Hand Temple Cellar\">Open Hand Temple Cellar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1049</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This prayerbook is blotted with tearstains, and a few of the pages bear the mark of frequent consultations.]\n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Adage 27</b>\n</p><p>In the face of aversion? Persevere.\n</p><p>In the face of aggression? Endure.\n</p><p>In the face of one who is suffering? Comfort.\n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Adage 33</b>\n</p><p>The Broken God must shed his tears, for without he would be heartless.\n</p><p>Likewise you will cry, you will weep, you will feel the lamentations cutting upon your shoulderblades.\n</p><p><br>\n[...]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>Adage 92</b>\n</p><p>[This entire entry has been scratched out in frustration.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205640\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1797/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34114/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9971/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933862/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.992      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   60.992      1 -total\n 63.44%   38.694      8 Template:Icon_text\n 56.81%   34.650     19 Template:Trim\n 34.42%   20.994      1 Template:PageSeo\n 34.36%   20.958      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.65%   16.867      3 Template:Icon_link\n 20.99%   12.805      8 Template:Ifempty\n 20.95%   12.775      1 Template:FRWiki\n 17.36%   10.591      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31320-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205640 and revision id 347809. Rendering was triggered becaus